i di protezione individuale possono trasformarsi rapidamente in situazioni pericolose. Imparate a riconoscere tempestivamente i pericoli e ad agire in modo sicuro.", "short_description": "Scoprite la sicurezza sul lavoro nell'edilizia in legno in modo virtuale e realistico: riconoscere i rischi tipici, reagire correttamente, senza alcun pericolo di lesioni. Imparate a evitare errori e a utilizzare in modo sicuro utensili e moduli."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "WoodConstructionCover - Querformat.png", "id": "1735425970481901", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821696_1735425973815234_7026648888461368653_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3vy5gayGBv8Q7kNvwFlGsEJ&_nc_oc=Adr3FmhoQC5ld_-mf1y5oh7jjBiEIwJltMnANUmRxZnEt8sT0bgkh0L8Uh_yJ_k_BqU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSl8MgvXyT7btypV-iYU03VhR3jqc2GfScngdUbMyv3GA&oe=6AF4A163"}, {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1404469407857988", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819845_1404469411191321_2374008257608234867_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Gn_q8cxob80Q7kNvwGPhO9A&_nc_oc=AdpHeExg0wLEqf3a5sdOZRUJi0rfqEIhsUDs3WEqRbEnOALmeK76-ipBqsVx_W0kfzs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTtiPEw4IGrWqsgrrd8PCL0RVFIjpE5hdfWHmt8XwF_sg&oe=6AF48D5D"}, {"file_name": "WoodConstructionCover - Hochformat.png", "id": "1138371601691473", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822307_1138371605024806_6545105809583793091_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pgErlLA1XBUQ7kNvwEu-eU2&_nc_oc=Adri16JLMRer7fA1IXvz3boIoHlQTtXL0sACBU6ROkBr-2bu2bm5LB97Z-CU6myK-DY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQOF_qb-S18MSYAArMObO_y7TbFCd9u7rg-q7miFMxRLg&oe=6AF47BCA"}, {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1061729109131103", "im